// Global, conditional (crates/velt_loader/src/globals): the hyperbolic functions of `Math` and
// their inverses (velt/lang/math/hyperbolic_functions), for a program that calls one; other
// programs don't load the ports behind them, and a program that calls one loads no other group's.
// load when std/prelude/math uses: .sinh .cosh .tanh .asinh .acosh .atanh
import "velt/lang/math/hyperbolic_functions";
